# =========================================================
# Cursor Rules — iOS SwiftUI Project: NCHUHelper
# Purpose: Course planning (空堂/衝堂) + Campus navigation
# Platform: iOS 17+, Xcode 15+, Swift 5.9, SwiftUI, MapKit
# Architecture: SwiftUI + MVVM + small Utils (no 3rd-party)
# =========================================================

###########################################################
## 0) GLOBAL PRINCIPLES｜全域原則
###########################################################
- Build from scratch. Do NOT assume existing files.
- Single-responsibility files; short functions; clear naming.
- Prefer Apple frameworks: Foundation, SwiftUI, MapKit, CoreLocation.
- No third-party dependencies unless explicitly requested.
- Fail gracefully: typed Error enums; no fatalError in production paths.
- Comments explain WHY over WHAT; keep previews for all major views.
- UI strings default to zh-Hant; code comments in English.
- Accessibility matters: meaningful labels, Dynamic Type-friendly.

Non-goals for MVP:
- No login/backend/sync.
- No background location; only “When In Use”.
- No AR/室內導航；僅室外導航到大樓。

###########################################################
## 1) PROJECT LAYOUT｜目錄規範（必須遵守）
###########################################################
/Models              # Data models (Codable, Hashable)
/ViewModels          # ObservableObject; business logic
/Views               # SwiftUI screens & components
/Utils               # Purist helpers (CSVImporter, formatters, validators)
/Data                # Stores/Loaders (BuildingStore, CoursesStore)
/Resources           # Seed JSON/CSV (Buildings.json, sample.csv)
/Assets.xcassets     # Images & colors
/PreviewContent      # Mock data for previews (optional)
/Tests               # Unit tests (logic), UI tests (optional)

File naming:
- Views end with `View` (e.g., HomeView.swift)
- ViewModels end with `VM` or `Store` (e.g., ScheduleVM.swift, CoursesStore.swift)
- One top-level type per file.

###########################################################
## 2) APP SCOPE｜App 範圍
###########################################################
App name: NCHUHelper
Goal: 幫大學生快速完成「選課空堂規劃 + 校園大樓導航」。

Screens:
- HomeView：兩張主卡片 → 「選課助手」與「校園地圖」。
- SchedulePlannerView：匯入 CSV → 顯示課程、衝堂標示、空檔計算（min length 可調）。
- CampusSearchView：搜尋大樓 code/name/aliases → 一鍵 Apple/Google Maps 導航。

Permissions & Info.plist:
- NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription = "用於校園地圖導航。"
- LSApplicationQueriesSchemes = ["comgooglemaps"]

Target: iOS 17+; Swift 5.9; SwiftUI; MapKit
Localization: zh-Hant 初版即可；集中重複字串於 `UIStrings` 靜態常數（可選）

###########################################################
## 3) MODELS｜資料模型（固定介面）
###########################################################
# /Models/Course.swift
struct Course: Identifiable, Codable, Hashable {
  enum RequiredType: String, Codable { case 必修, 選修, 通識 }
  let id: UUID
  var name: String
  var dept: String
  var requiredType: RequiredType
  var dayOfWeek: Int       // 1=Mon … 7=Sun
  var periods: [Int]       // 1..N（每節）
  var weeks: [Int]         // 1..18（學期週）
  var buildingCode: String
  var room: String
  var instructor: String?
  var credits: Int?
}

# /Models/Building.swift
struct Building: Identifiable, Codable, Hashable {
  let id: UUID
  var code: String         // e.g., "工綜館"
  var name: String         // e.g., "工程綜合館"
  var aliases: [String]
  var lat: Double
  var lng: Double
  var openHours: String?
}

###########################################################
## 4) VIEWMODELS｜邏輯層合約
###########################################################
# /ViewModels/ScheduleVM.swift
@MainActor final class ScheduleVM: ObservableObject {
  @Published var courses: [Course] = []

  /// Return pairs of conflicting courses (same day & overlapping periods).
  func conflicts(in courses: [Course]) -> [(Course, Course)]

  /// Convenience: set of course IDs that appear in any conflict pair.
  func conflictedCourseIDs(in courses: [Course]) -> Set<UUID>

  /// Compute contiguous free slots for a given day; drop intervals shorter than minLength.
  func freeSlots(
    courses: [Course],
    on day: Int,
    totalPeriods: ClosedRange<Int> = 1...14,
    minLength: Int = 2
  ) -> [ClosedRange<Int>]
}

# /Data/BuildingStore.swift
@MainActor final class BuildingStore: ObservableObject {
  @Published var all: [Building] = []
  func load() throws  // Load Resources/Buildings.json; decode to all.
  func search(matching keyword: String) -> [Building]  // code/name/aliases contains (case-insensitive)
}

# /Data/CoursesStore.swift（選做：持久化）
@MainActor final class CoursesStore: ObservableObject {
  @Published var courses: [Course] = []
  func load() throws
  func save() throws
}

###########################################################
## 5) UTILS｜工具合約
###########################################################
# /Utils/CSVImporter.swift
struct CSVImportResult { let courses: [Course]; let warnings: [String] }
enum CSVImportError: Error { case badHeader, badRow(Int, String) }

struct CSVImporter {
  /// Parse CSV data into courses. Columns (fixed order):
  /// name,dept,requiredType,dayOfWeek,periods,weeks,buildingCode,room,instructor,credits
  /// periods/weeks separated by "|", e.g., "3|4|5"; requiredType in {必修, 選修, 通識}
  static func parseCourses(from data: Data) throws -> CSVImportResult
}

# /Utils/FreeSlotFormatter.swift
struct FreeSlotFormatter {
  /// Convert daily slots mapping (day -> [range]) into human-readable zh-Hant string,
  /// e.g., "週一：3–4、7–9\n週二：…"
  static func formatDailySlots(_ dict: [Int: [ClosedRange<Int>]]) -> String
}

###########################################################
## 6) VIEWS｜畫面需求
###########################################################
# /Views/HomeView.swift
- NavigationStack + 2 Cards (選課助手 / 校園地圖)
- 使用 SF Symbols + 簡短描述
- #Preview with static preview models

# /Views/SchedulePlannerView.swift
- Buttons: 「匯入 CSV」、Stepper(最小空檔連續節數：預設2)
- List: 課程（名稱/星期節次/必選通），若衝堂 → 顯示「⚠️ 衝堂」Tag 或紅色樣式
- Result: 「本週空檔」區塊（使用 FreeSlotFormatter）
- Search（可選）：依課名/教師關鍵字過濾
- 使用 ScheduleVM（@StateObject），若採持久化則綁 CoursesStore

# /Views/CampusSearchView.swift
- SearchBar: 即時過濾 code/name/aliases
- List: 顯示名稱、代號，按鈕「Apple Map」「Google Map」
- Apple Map URL: http://maps.apple.com/?ll=lat,lng&q=name
- Google Maps URL: comgooglemaps://?q=lat,lng(,name)；若 canOpenURL false → web fallback
- 使用 BuildingStore（.task/.onAppear 時 load）

全數視圖需提供 #Preview；預覽用固定 mock。

###########################################################
## 7) RESOURCES｜資源檔
###########################################################
/Resources/Buildings.json
- 放 10–20 筆示例：{code,name,aliases[],lat,lng}
- 太陽餅式假資料即可；後續可替換為真實校園座標。

/Resources/sample_courses.csv（可選）
- 範例列：
  離散數學,資訊,必修,2,3|4,1|2|3|4|5,工綜館,204,張老師,3

###########################################################
## 8) INFO.PLIST & PERMISSIONS
###########################################################
- NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription = "用於校園地圖導航。"
- LSApplicationQueriesSchemes = ["comgooglemaps"]
- iPhone/iPad orientations: portrait + landscape (default fine)

###########################################################
## 9) TESTS｜測試
###########################################################
- Add unit tests under /Tests:
  - CSV parsing: valid line, bad numbers, empty lines → warnings collected
  - Conflict detection: same day overlap → conflict; different day → no conflict
  - Free slots: edges (start/end), isolated occupied period, minLength filtering

- Optional UI tests: smoke test navigation Home → Schedule/Campus.

###########################################################
## 10) CODING STANDARDS｜程式風格
###########################################################
- Swift 5.9; use async/await for async tasks
- Prefer value types; Codable/Hashable for models
- Use `guard` early returns; avoid deep nesting
- No force-unwraps; use `if let`/`guard let` or throw
- Minimal imports; mark ViewModels touching UI as `@MainActor`
- `// MARK:` for structure; Docstring for public funcs

Formatting:
- 4-space indent; ~120 col soft wrap; trailing whitespace trimmed

###########################################################
## 11) PERFORMANCE & SAFETY
###########################################################
- Complexity: O(N log N) acceptable for 100–300 courses
- Avoid heavy work on main thread; file IO off main if long-running
- Memory: release temp buffers; avoid duplicating large arrays needlessly

###########################################################
## 12) UX & ACCESSIBILITY
###########################################################
- Buttons have text labels; not icon-only
- Dynamic Type friendly; avoid fixed heights unless necessary
- Color contrast readable; red tag for conflicts with text fallback

###########################################################
## 13) MILESTONES｜提交節點（Cursor 任務順序）
###########################################################
M1: 初始化專案與目錄；建立 App 入口（HomeView） + Dummy #Preview
M2: 實作 Models；建立 ScheduleVM skeleton；加入 FreeSlotFormatter
M3: CSVImporter → 匯入 CSV → 更新課程 → 基本 List 展示
M4: 衝堂偵測 + UI 標示；空檔計算 + 顯示
M5: BuildingStore 載入 Buildings.json；CampusSearchView 搜尋與導航；Info.plist 更新
M6 (optional): CoursesStore 持久化；Tests 補齊；輕量 UI polish

每一里程碑：提交變更檔案列表、主要類別/函式、測試方式說明。

###########################################################
## 14) COMMIT & PR STYLE｜提交規範
###########################################################
Conventional commits:
- feat: add CSV importer
- feat: conflicts detection in ScheduleVM
- feat: campus search & navigation
- fix: handle invalid CSV rows
- refactor: extract FreeSlotFormatter
- test: add unit tests for CSV/conflicts/free slots
- docs: update README about Info.plist

PR checklist:
- [ ] Build passes (iOS 17 simulator)
- [ ] SwiftUI previews compile
- [ ] No new warnings
- [ ] Tests added/updated for logic
- [ ] Info.plist entries verified

